`iter_analysis_units` raises a `ValueError` when `descriptor_families` names a family the container does not have, naming it and the families present. A misspelled family used to give no units in eight of the nine descriptor modes (a `RuntimeError` in `sensor` mode), and a list mixing real and misspelled names silently left the misspelled ones out. `analysis_mode="flat"` now applies `descriptor_families` for descriptor inputs, as every other mode does, instead of returning all families.
